    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fast and furious racing game is situated around the infamous exploits of the revered Japanese night racing fraternity, The Midnight Club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With friends to impress and money to burn, these hot blooded individuals corrupt their cars by allowing specialist workshops to turbo charge and re-kit their motors in order to produce the ultimate thrill-seeking machines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight different racing environments and ten courses. Ranging from open forests and mountain courses to city and warehouse districts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street races take place on unofficial tracks, (also known as civilian roads) above and around the busiest cities in Japan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An array of different game modes to select from: Simulation Arcade, Quick Race, Time Attack. Pininfarina Junior and Senior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight exclusive car designs from the world famous automotive design agency, Pininfarina.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fast and furious racing game is situated around the infamous exploits of the revered Japanese night racing fraternity, The Midnight Club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With friends to impress and money to burn, these hot blooded individuals corrupt their cars by allowing specialist workshops to turbo charge and re-kit their motors in order to produce the ultimate thrill-seeking machines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight different racing environments and ten courses. Ranging from open forests and mountain courses to city and warehouse districts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street races take place on unofficial tracks, (also known as civilian roads) above and around the busiest cities in Japan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An array of different game modes to select from: Simulation Arcade, Quick Race, Time Attack. Pininfarina Junior and Senior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight exclusive car designs from the world famous automotive design agency, Pininfarina.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Take control of the streets of Japan in Midnight GT: Primary Racer. Race along country back roads or tight city streets and work your way up in the world. The only way to new places is to win!",
